{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかいさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元さんと伊藤さんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/4753232/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つーんつーんつーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅ(齋藤飛鳥chan)に言われて気付いた。最近のひめたんのくせです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つーんって言いながらみんなの腕とか背中とかつつくの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに鼻をつつくときは「ぴんぽーん」ね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅしゅに「ぴんぽーん」したら、「何でしょう」って答えてくれるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「飛鳥ちゃんいますかー？」て聞いてみましょう＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あ帰ってください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/4753232/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/4753232/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/4753232/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」て答えてくれますよ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっしゅっしゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かーわいーいねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はunder stationでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方ありがとう(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅ(齋藤飛鳥chan)せいたん(畠中清羅chan)あみ(能條愛未chan)ひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あら素敵なめんつね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんわーるど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんわーるど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみわーるど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちろちろぽん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで最後におうたも歌えたしね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくはオンエアをちぇーっくしてみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログごめんね(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは元気よ。レッスン頑張ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なliveになりますように。ちろちろぽん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}